:** The current strategy tries to re-select historical candidates, but they're already selected. The third round only got 4 hits out of 128 queries (3.125% precision), suggesting we need better exploration or a way to find similar genes to the hits.\n\nLet me check if there's a way to use gene similarity search by looking at the configuration.\n", 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_0978a438b640423186ec0db5', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'search_file_content', 'arguments': '{"pattern": "BDA_GENE_SEARCH|achilles", "dir_path": "/inspire/qb-ilm/project/cq-scientific-cooperation-zone/public/ywang/meta-harness-evolver/project/test/project-bda/hoss-evolution-workspaces/Sanchez21/run-2"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_0978a438b640423186ec0db5', 'content': '{\n  "content": "Found 4 matches for pattern \\"BDA_GENE_SEARCH|achilles\\" in path \\"/inspire/qb-ilm/project/cq-scientific-cooperation-zone/public/ywang/meta-harness-evolver/project/test/project-bda/hoss-evolution-workspaces/Sanchez21/run-2\\" (strategy: rg):\\n---\\nFile: candidates/candidate_1/traces/evolver-proposer-e174b0dd.log\\nL59: ## Optional Tool: Gene Search (Achilles)\\nL60: When enabled by the runner (`BDA_GENE_SEARCH=1` and `BDA_CSV_PATH` points to a directory containing `achilles.csv`),\\nL66: This returns candidate indices for similar (or diverse) genes using Achilles features.\\nL160: 2026-04-30 07:19:32,156 [openai._base_client] DEBUG: Request options: {\'method\': \'post\', \'url\': \'/chat/completions\', \'files\': None, \'idempotency_key\': \'stainless-python-retry-64da935f-2f56-4378-b0bd-877d5c14f921\', \'content\': None, \'json_data\': {\'messages\': [{\'role\': \'system\', \'content\': \'You are a non-interactive CLI agent specializing in software engineering tasks. Your primary goal is to help users safely and efficiently, adhering strictly to the following instructions and utilizing your available tools.\\\\n\\\\n# Core Mandates\\\\n\\\\n- **Conventions:** Rigorously adhere to